; TEST: expect-exit=200
;
; `load`/`store` in every byte order at every whole-byte width the emitter
; assembles byte by byte (ssa-ir.md 2.7; wire-codec.md milestone M4):
; `maior` and `minor` at 16/24/32/64, `maior` at 40 and 56, `minor` at 48,
; `nativus` at 24 (which on this little-endian host IS `minor`), and a
; negative i40. Every store is READ BACK BYTE BY BYTE with `load u8
; nativus` -- the one-instruction path M4 did not touch, so a store and a
; load that were wrong the same way cannot agree with each other and pass --
; then read back whole in its own order. The 80-byte slot is pre-filled
; with 0xAA and every case is followed by an untouched guard byte, so a store
; that wrote one byte too many (or too few) shows at the guard.
;
; The loaded value is canonical (ssa-ir.md 2.2): `cmp.eq` is a 64-bit
; compare, so a u24 load leaving anything above bit 23 never equals its
; expected constant, and the i16/i24/i40 loads must come back
; sign-extended.
;
; Mutations (run): __bfa_byte_addr's `maior`/`minor` branch inverted ->
; exit 2 (byte 1 holds 0x34, not 0x12); the signed normalisation after a
; byte-by-byte load dropped -> exit 87 (i40 -2 comes back as 2^40 - 2).
;
; A CHECK CHAIN: check k compares one value and on a mismatch returns k.
; All 91 right: exit 200.
;
;    1      guard byte 0                       = 0xaa, untouched
;    2-3    store u16 0x1234 maior at 1        bytes 12 34
;    4      guard byte 3                       = 0xaa, untouched
;    5      load u16 maior at 1                = 0x1234
;    6-7    store u16 0x1234 minor at 4        bytes 34 12
;    8      guard byte 6                       = 0xaa, untouched
;    9      load u16 minor at 4                = 0x1234
;   10-12   store u24 0xab12cd maior at 7      bytes ab 12 cd
;   13      guard byte 10                      = 0xaa, untouched
;   14      load u24 maior at 7                = 0xab12cd
;   15-17   store u24 0xab12cd minor at 11     bytes cd 12 ab
;   18      guard byte 14                      = 0xaa, untouched
;   19      load u24 minor at 11               = 0xab12cd
;   20-23   store u32 0xdeadbeef maior at 15   bytes de ad be ef
;   24      guard byte 19                      = 0xaa, untouched
;   25      load u32 maior at 15               = 0xdeadbeef
;   26-29   store u32 0xdeadbeef minor at 20   bytes ef be ad de
;   30      guard byte 24                      = 0xaa, untouched
;   31      load u32 minor at 20               = 0xdeadbeef
;   32-39   store u64 0x102030405060708 maior at 25 bytes 01 02 03 04 05 06 07 08
;   40      guard byte 33                      = 0xaa, untouched
;   41      load u64 maior at 25               = 0x102030405060708
;   42-49   store u64 0x102030405060708 minor at 34 bytes 08 07 06 05 04 03 02 01
;   50      guard byte 42                      = 0xaa, untouched
;   51      load u64 minor at 34               = 0x102030405060708
;   52-56   store u40 0x102030405 maior at 43  bytes 01 02 03 04 05
;   57      guard byte 48                      = 0xaa, untouched
;   58      load u40 maior at 43               = 0x102030405
;   59-64   store u48 0xa0b0c0d0e0f minor at 49 bytes 0f 0e 0d 0c 0b 0a
;   65      guard byte 55                      = 0xaa, untouched
;   66      load u48 minor at 49               = 0xa0b0c0d0e0f
;   67-73   store u56 0x11223344556677 maior at 56 bytes 11 22 33 44 55 66 77
;   74      guard byte 63                      = 0xaa, untouched
;   75      load u56 maior at 56               = 0x11223344556677
;   76-78   store u24 0x123456 nativus at 64   bytes 56 34 12
;   79      guard byte 67                      = 0xaa, untouched
;   80      load u24 nativus at 64             = 0x123456
;   81-85   store i40 -2 maior at 68           bytes ff ff ff ff fe
;   86      guard byte 73                      = 0xaa, untouched
;   87      load i40 maior at 68               = -2
;   88      load u24 minor at 64               = 0x123456: nativus is minor on this host
;   89      load u8 maior at 7                 = 0xab: one byte has no order
;   90      load i16 maior at 15               = -8531: sign-extended
;   91      load i24 minor at 11               = -5565747: sign-extended

